Because Billy is in a wheelchair, Michael has decided that he's pretty sure Billy is going

1455
00:53:51.100 --> 00:53:57.240
to lecture us about the proper way to treat disabled people and back up the fact that

1456
00:53:57.240 --> 00:53:58.780
Michael has been so wronged.

