I feel like Ryan isn't really trying that hard to look for these yams, because I think if he just went to the grocery store.

1520
00:56:43.680 --> 00:56:46.960
Carbondale is about 25 minutes outside of Scranton.

1521
00:56:47.380 --> 00:56:53.000
Ryan hits a number of the sort of surrounding counties on his search for the yaMs.

